  "load_rule": "Total carried mass is the exact sum of registered held/equipped quantities. Burden is strength-relative: Strength is the dominant load-support input, Endurance modestly improves sustained carrying, and travel, pursuit and exact combat derive movement/reaction/fatigue effects from the resulting burden ratio. There is no slot inventory.",
